enthusiasm to tackle the portable bones patch.

[1] That's not actually possible as the level remembers if a spot was 
part of a room or not. So if you dig a pit in a room position and push a 
boulder in it, it's a room spot, and if you dig a hole in corridor 
position and push a boulder in it, it's still a corridor position.

Wall and door(way) positions when dug or destroyed turn into doorway 
positions that are shown as room glyph[4]. Solid rock is turned into 
corridor.

[2] This meantime is part of the total time I'm devoting to NetHack. 
Most of my time goes to studying.

